§ `Rule 2 -- the gathered answer`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Arguments: action, kind, decision of a lower Court under the revoked Rules, the Code provides otherwise,
-- the Court otherwise directs, any other written law otherwise provides, appeal arising from (9) or (11) proceedings.
