#ASSERT `o 1 r 2 these Rules apply to the proceedings` (`test action` `Singapore International Commercial Court` (Date 1 6 2023)) `o 1 r 2(3)(a) civil proceedings in the Supreme Court or the State Courts` FALSE NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 1 r 2 these Rules apply to the proceedings` (`test action` `Singapore International Commercial Court` (Date 1 6 2023)) `o 1 r 2(3)(a) civil proceedings in the Supreme Court or the State Courts` FALSE NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A proceeding of a kind in the Table: ask provision by provision.
#ASSERT `o 1 r 2 these Rules apply to the proceedings` (`test action` `General Division` (Date 1 6 2023)) `o 1 r 2(11) item 1 proceedings under the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
