-- Nothing in the module answers: "other proceedings" in a District Court, not under the revoked Rules.
#ASSERT `o 1 r 2 these Rules apply to the proceedings` (`test action` `District Court` (Date 1 6 2023)) `o 1 r 2 other proceedings` FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
